    "_notes": "The turn: the old object, then what it names here. Daniel's copy verbatim.\n     'Signet Artists brings distinctive artists to distinctive moments' is the\n     positioning line and gets its own paragraph weight rather than a pull\n     quote, which would ask the sentence to perform.",
